<body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;">Ref No: {{{Case.Case_Number__c}}}<br />
<br />
Hi{{{Case.First_Name__c}}},
<p>Thank you for contacting the Qantas Customer Care team. I'm&nbsp;sorry to hear you were disappointed with the content of our inflight entertainment on your recent flight.<br />
<br />
<strong>Our commitment to creating a child-friendly environment</strong><br />
<br />
We work closely with the Office of Film and Literature Classification, and we’re governed by their requirements and recommendations. All movies carry the Australian classification and additional advisories as to the nature of the classified content.<br />
<br />
While our cabin crew can block movies to a child’s seat at the parent’s request, we do rely on our customers to make their own viewing choices and to supervise their children accordingly.<br />
<br />
Any movies classified ‘M’ and above are automatically blocked for unaccompanied minors. Our entertainment guide also carries advisories for movies containing violence or scenes of a sexual nature.<br />
<br />
<strong>We value your opinion</strong><br />
<br />
Customer feedback plays an important role in our continuous improvement process so that we can provide you with exceptional service from start to finish.<br />
<br />
I’d like to assure you that your comments have been passed onto the relevant team for review.<br />
<br />
Thank you for taking the time to tell us about your experience <b>—&nbsp;</b>I hope this information helps when travelling with your family in future.</p>
</body>
</html>